{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1042","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Petya and Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Petya has an array $$$a$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ integers. He has learned partial sums recently, and now he can calculate the sum of elements on any segment of the array really fast. The segment is a non-empty sequence of elements standing one next to another in the array."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Now he wonders what is the number of segments in his array with the sum less than $$$t$$$. Help Petya to calculate this number."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"More formally, you are required to calculate the number of pairs $$$l, r$$$ ($$$l \\le r$$$) such that $$$a_l + a_{l+1} + \\dots + a_{r-1} + a_r \\lt t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 200\\,000, |t| \\le 2\\cdot10^{14}$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains a sequence of integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$|a_{i}| \\le 10^{9}$$$) — the description of Petya's array. Note that there might be negative, zero and positive elements."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the number of segments in Petya's array with the sum of elements less than $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5 4\n5 -1 3 4 -1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3 0\n-1 2 -3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 -1\n-2 1 -2 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example the following segments have sum less than $$$4$$$:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2, 2]$$$, sum of elements is $$$-1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[2, 3]$$$, sum of elements is $$$2$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[3, 3]$$$, sum of elements is $$$3$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[4, 5]$$$, sum of elements is $$$3$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$[5, 5]$$$, sum of elements is $$$-1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1042D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1042/problem/D"}